title: MacDougal_hotdog_1
---
-> Notice the hotdog cart.
    You: Wait, is that new?
    Clea: MacDougal Dogs? I think so
    You: MacDougal Dogs? You've gotta be kidding me
    Clea: You have a better idea?
    You: Yeah, Mac-DOG-als!
    Clea: Oh my god
    You: They had the perfect name right there!
    Name aside, it seems like a perfectly good hot dog cart.
    You wonder whether you and Clea would have had less arguments about where to eat on campus if this place had been an option when you were students.
    You were so intertwined back then, you had wanted to eat every meal together.
    You realize that not much has changed.
    <<jump MacDougal_hotdog_1>>
-> Take Photo
    <<jump TakePicture>>
-> Leave
===
title: MacDougal_arch_2
---
