    You: There she is, in her splendor
    Clea: Just as romantic as I remember it
    Some part of you remembers that Clea didn't always think the arch was romantic.
    Now that you think about it, you're pretty sure she used to make fun of those people taking engagement photos under the arch.
    <<jump MacDougal_arch_3>>
-> Take Photo
    <<jump TakePicture>>
-> Leave
