*
<<FadeIn>>
// FADE IN
<<set $car_scene_number += 1>>


This place hadn't felt like a real pioneering town when you worked here.
Your amateur acting certainly hadn't helped sell the authenticity.
Now, standing before the rotting beams of abandoned buildings, the town feels more real as a ghost of itself.
You shiver a bit, despite yourself.
