title: Town_foliage_4
---
-> Remember the poison ivy.
    Clea: Please don't take a picture of that. 
    You: What? You don't think it's funny in a comedy = tragedy + time kinda way?
    Clea: I don't want to ever think about when we got poison ivy ever again. Worst two weeks of my LIFE.
    You: Can't argue with that
    You try to make light of the situation, but the poison ivy debacle does get to you sometimes.
    You remember Clea going off the path and brushing up against some poison ivy, but when you tried to tell her, she had started panicking and making things even worse.
    You wanted to stop her from getting even more on herself, but the only thing you could think to do was run in and grab her.
    Would it really have been so hard to help her without getting yourself covered too?
    You're probably overthinking things.
    <<jump Town_foliage_4>>
-> Take Photo
    <<jump TakePicture>>
